    {
      "text": "持续维修列车零件；一旦列车停下，暴风雪中的异物就可能现身猎杀。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Keep it running by maintaining its parts, because if the train stops, there’s no telling what abomination might emerge from the blizzard to claim you...",
