      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "大中型物品会真实挂在角色身上，存放身体位置直接决定取用速度。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Big and medium-sized items are physically displayed on the character, and the speed at which he can fetch them depends on where an item is located on the body: a magazine will be quicker to insert if it's stored on the chest rather than on the lower back!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4132890/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
